<Patch>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef[defName="VRE_Microsized"]</xpath>
    <nomatch>
      <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
        <xpath>/Defs</xpath>
        <value>
          <VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef ParentName="VRE_MutationGene">
            <defName>VRE_Microsized</defName>
            <label>microsized</label>
            <description>Carriers of this gene exhibit a microsized stature, significantly smaller than their counterparts. Their reduced size results in increased stagger duration, lower meat and leather yield, and a smaller yet more efficient hunger requirement.</description>
            <iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/Gene_Microsized</iconPath>
            <unlockable>false</unlockable>
            <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
            <displayOrderInCategory>1000</displayOrderInCategory>
            <statOffsets>
              <VEF_BodySize_Offset>-0.45</VEF_BodySize_Offset>
            </statOffsets>
            <statFactors>
              <StaggerDurationFactor>2</StaggerDurationFactor>
              <MeatAmount>0.5</MeatAmount>
              <LeatherAmount>0.5</LeatherAmount>
              <VEF_FoodCapacityMultiplier>0.75</VEF_FoodCapacityMultiplier>
            </statFactors>
            <exclusionTags>
              <li>InsectorSize</li>
            </exclusionTags>
            <symbolPack>
              <prefixSymbols>
                <li>
                  <symbol>small</symbol>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <symbol>tiny</symbol>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <symbol>mini</symbol>
                </li>
              </prefixSymbols>
            </symbolPack>
            <modExtensions>
              <li Class="VanillaGenesExpanded.GeneExtension">
                <backgroundPathEndogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_MutationBG</backgroundPathEndogenes>
                <backgroundPathXenogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_MutationBG</backgroundPathXenogenes>
                <hediffToWholeBody>VRE_Microsized</hediffToWholeBody>
              </li>
            </modExtensions>
          </VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef>
          <VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef ParentName="VRE_MutationGene">
            <defName>VRE_Colossal</defName>
            <label>colossal</label>
            <description>Carriers of this gene grow to colossal proportions, towering over their peers. Their immense size increases meat and leather yield and hunger needs, while reducing movement speed and melee dodge chance. If equipped with the right enhancements, they can carry the heaviest of weapons and warcasket armaments.</description>
            <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
            <iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/Gene_Colossal</iconPath>
            <unlockable>false</unlockable>
            <displayOrderInCategory>1001</displayOrderInCategory>
            <statOffsets>
              <MoveSpeed>-1.6</MoveSpeed>
              <VEF_BodySize_Offset>0.65</VEF_BodySize_Offset>
            </statOffsets>
            <statFactors>
              <StaggerDurationFactor>0.2</StaggerDurationFactor>
              <MeatAmount>2</MeatAmount>
              <LeatherAmount>2</LeatherAmount>
              <VEF_FoodCapacityMultiplier>2</VEF_Fom‘apacityMultiplier>
              <MeleeDodgeChance>0.25</MeleeDodgeChance>
            </statFactors>
            <exclusionTags>
              <li>InsectorSize</li>
            </exclusionTags>
            <symbolPack>
              <prefixSymbols>
                <li>
                  <symbol>large</symbol>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <symbol>big</symbol>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <symbol>magni</symbol>
                </li>
              </prefixSymbols>
            </symbolPack>
            <modExtensions>
              <li Class="VanillaGenesExpanded.GeneExtension">
                <backgroundPathEndogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_MutationBG</backgroundPathEndogenes>
                <backgroundPathXenogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_MutationBG</backgroundPathXenogenes>
                <hediffToWholeBody>VRE_Colossal</hediffToWholeBody>
              </li>
            </modExtensions>
          </VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef>
          <VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef ParentName="VRE_MutationGene">
            <defName>VRE_ChemfuelSacks</defName>
            <label>chemfuel sacks</label>
            <description>Carriers of this gene develop chemfuel sacks resembling a tail, drastically increasing their susceptibility to flame damage. If engulfed in large enough flames or upon death, they erupt in a fiery explosion. Additionally, they can be "milked" periodically to yield chemfuel.</description>
            <iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/Gene_ChemfuelSacks</iconPath>
            <unlockable>false</unlockable>
            <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
            <displayOrderInCategory>1002</displayOrderInCategory>
            <damageFactors>
              <Flame>2</Flame>
            </damageFactors>
            <customEffectDescriptions>
              <li>Time running in panic when set on fire doubled.</li>
              <li>Produces 30 chemfuel every 10 days.</li>
              <li>If set on fire, and the fire is at least 35 in size, they explode in a fire explosion. Upon fire explosion, they will not explode again for 24 hours.</li>
            </customEffectDescriptions>
            <exclusionTags>
              <li>Tail</li>
              <li>InsectorFire</li>
            </exclusionTags>
            <symbolPack>
              <prefixSymbols>
                <li>
                  <symbol>fuel</symbol>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <symbol>chem</symbol>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <symbol>petrol</symbol>
                </li>
              </prefixSymbols>
            </symbolPack>
            <modExtensions>
              <li Class="VanillaGenesExpanded.GeneExtension">
                <backgroundPathEndogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_MutationBG</backgroundPathEndogenes>
                <backgroundPathXenogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_MutationBG</backgroundPathXenogenes>
                <hediffToWholeBody>VRE_ChemfuelSacks</hediffToWholeBody>
              </li>
            </modExtensions>
          </VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef>
